  {
    "source": "A SPACE THAT FEELS LIKE YOURS",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Wellness, beyond the usual.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We believe wellness is more than a workout, a treatment or a moment of escape.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "It is how you feel when you leave a room.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The people you meet.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The conversations you have.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The rituals you return to.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "And the space you create for yourself amidst everything else.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The Sphere brings these moments together through carefully curated experiences designed exclusively for women.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "From movement and mindful practices to intimate conversations, immersive experiences and moments of stillness — every gathering is designed with intention.",
    "pages": []
  },
  {
    "source": "WHY THE SPHERE?",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Because a woman needs a space that is just for her.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "You may be a founder.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A mother.",
    "pages": [
      "journal/the-modern-woman/index.html",
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A leader.",
    "pages": [
      "journal/the-modern-woman/index.html",
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A daughter.",
    "pages": [
      "journal/the-modern-woman/index.html",
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A partner.",
    "pages": [
      "journal/the-modern-woman/index.html",
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A friend.",
    "pages": [
      "journal/the-modern-woman/index.html",
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "You may be building something extraordinary.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "But beyond every role you hold, there is you.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The Sphere exists to create a little more room for that woman.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A place where you don't have to perform, achieve or keep up.",
    "pages": [
      "index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "You simply arrive.",
    "pages": [
      "index.html"
    ]
  },
