  {
    "source": "IS WELLNESS A LUXURY OR A NECESSITY?",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We believe it is a necessity.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "For a woman constantly giving her time, energy and attention to everyone around her, taking care of herself can often become the last item on the list.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The Sphere challenges that idea.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We believe taking care of yourself isn't indulgence.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "It is part of living well.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "And sometimes, choosing yourself begins with something as simple as showing up for an hour.",
    "pages": [
      "philosophy/index.html"
    ]
  },
